e" data-rid="812ecafe-0dda-433f-90b3-4a813cee302d" class="r-1x90vbw"><div data-rid="9faeb69b-f396-47b1-814e-10657cb8a6ba" class="r-hqibw4"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-101bzgr" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1 8a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h11.793l-3.147-3.146a.5.5 0 0 1 .708-.708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .708l-4 4a.5.5 0 0 1-.708-.708L13.293 8.5H1.5A.5.5 0 0 1 1 8"></path></svg></div></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="1d42e389-69b2-4026-822b-2097154bfd2e" class="r-1lq8rhl"><div data-rid="a1a428b2-8e8d-4a21-bd9b-f0c671426aa6" class="r-1r1xnrr alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Frequently Asked Questions</p></span></div><div data-rid="5e134d86-a56d-4122-9322-279cf25f7289" class="r-1f6jcye alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>No matter what your question is about this magical cooler, we are always on hand to provide prompt and accurate answers.</p></span></div><div data-rid="672bb6b9-59b3-4772-aeb8-9e8ad2d8f5be" class="r-1ns36oz"><div data-rid="3466ea71-9444-44e7-b9e9-aec6f907d1c9" class="r-14icuh5" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="170378c8-b91a-4352-8322-81a972b7714d" aria-controls="replo-:Ru32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1eqgptd"><div data-rid="92f44749-afad-4bb2-9c41-d13461a9763a" class="r-1qqgpni"><div data-rid="7a2280d0-24d4-4534-b886-661cc7c1ea09" class="r-1n16jjx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h4>How long will it hold ice?</h4></span></div></div><div data-rid="63b49707-f11b-4f66-a329-2a2359c505cf" class="r-3i15mm"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-plus-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="16"></line><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"></line></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Ru32:"><div data-rid="b369aa2c-7e1c-4970-96cd-4b1adaf1e893" class="r-8hu78j"><div data-rid="127c074e-c2f8-4656-a162-fb2998a7eb1d" class="r-9uq4z7 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Up to 55 Hours!<br><br>Truth is, it depends on conditions(110 degrees outside or nice spring day), but we think of Monti as your "All Day" cooler. In tests we've conducted it kept temperatures ice/water below 40 degrees for over ~36 hours in a 70 degree room.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="a59f0921-5da9-4a62-8e6a-038b941cdf66" class="r-qr27e1" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="1bb23a60-89da-4b10-b546-ee3f91c84532" aria-controls="replo-:R1e32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-2hv1ze"><div data-rid="ae20dc97-392b-4d11-bfe8-818b15f85a3b" class="r-pf4ieh"><div data-rid="7751e271-6704-4917-9ca1-9b54e7af4f4c" class="r-1d1c4up alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>What are the dimensions?</h3></span></div></div><div data-rid="1fc56298-55f6-4092-9049-e9a57eb28326" class="r-1ff75l2"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-plus-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="16"></line><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"></line></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R1e32:"><div data-rid="93a0e3d1-ceeb-4b45-b61c-c52476aff0f5" class="r-8q2nra"><div data-rid="68511036-5da5-4e12-bcd5-9bcebd8bb67a" class="r-z064m8 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Mayfly:</strong> <br>18"H x 9"W x 5"D<br>14 liter capacity <br><br><strong>Shasta: <br></strong>20"H x 10"W x 6.5"D<br>21 liter capacity</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="812733ec-0b34-465b-8d2a-6649d25c3b65" class="r-4uidpk" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="573f5351-34c2-4906-a136-9c577b285020" aria-controls="replo-:R1u32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1kp0q2e"><div data-rid="f3302bf4-18d4-4024-89df-6cb1cd75d28a" class="r-v4igl"><div data-rid="bccf9860-88ab-49a0-977e-2aaa8180ded4" class="r-19ipjjg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>How do you use the stuff sack?</h3></span></div></div><div data-rid="e7e18d5a-8264-40e8-bacf-c1c37d7bd1d8" class="r-y1zy80"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-plus-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="16"></line><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"></line></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R1u32:"><div data-rid="070c494d-1f11-415c-9ee6-cfed8412b4ad" class="r-4tjd9a"><div data-rid="b29dc5c9-5944-4d73-b017-eb72f372da51" class="r-19zpslc alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The stuff sack is built into the cooler itself. The exterior zippered pocket IS the stuff sack. Simply reach into the pocket, grab a big handful of the body of the cooler and start to turn the cooler inside out, pushing the body of the cooler into the inside out pocket you've created. The cooler's convenient stuff sack is seamlessly integrated into its design, making it easy to store and carry.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f8c00c53-55fc-4efe-9b68-a5ae32509c7e" class="r-54b13g" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="85ceef23-92cd-4255-b79e-cd46197383a1" aria-controls="replo-:R2e32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1c6uve7"><div data-rid="276a71db-afd4-4989-8898-1c93a42fc35d" class="r-6zybji"><div data-rid="9b6e303b-4896-49b8-95ec-df819d8d138c" class="r-147cart alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>What is the return policy?</h3></span></div></div><div data-rid="7547c968-1614-462d-84c4-7302e7b8c500" class="r-utxtbu"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-plus-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="16"></line><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"></line></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R2e32:"><div data-rid="809df12b-de69-4763-9ac2-bd345448a369" class="r-1pinv9y"><div data-rid="620e7eef-c4cf-4901-b2f1-716161cb6b65" class="r-1ki7mlw alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>What is the return policy?</h3><p><br></p><p><strong>Monti Guarantee:</strong> Changed your mind? No problem! Just let us know and you can return your unused cooler for a full refund within the first 30 days of purchase.</p><h3>Which size should I get?</h3></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="97406820-7ca3-4f69-b1c3-05184709663a" class="r-1xnostr" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="37f8ce96-b1da-4763-ac5c-c8a4c98f44a7" aria-controls="replo-:R2u32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-n00d8i"><div data-rid="3bf13d14-c7f5-41ed-a523-afab17ba3351" class="r-18j6uj5"><div data-rid="11d80f48-88b0-4c12-8232-37c9ba4b233f" class="r-1eiv63c alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>Which size should I get?</h3></span></div></div><div data-rid="1beaae20-a58b-4f00-abbc-440da426b0e2" class="r-1fyufhc"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-plus-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="16"></line><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"></line></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R2u32:"><div data-rid="6bdab803-6a2b-4966-8958-284610c47b1e" class="r-1uh98kd"><div data-rid="667e4876-6fd4-4e3c-8465-0756ed86e06a" class="r-sbwdju alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>If you're unsure, consider the Shasta, as it is the most versatile. <br><br>The simplest way to decide is by looking at the capacity. The Shasta will never be "too big" because the roll top design ensures that it is compressed down to match the size of what you have inside it. (ie if you have only 6 cans in the cooler, you will roll the top down further). So really it comes down to your needs. Picnic with friends? Shasta. A simple bottle of wine and a few water bottles or a lunch sack for work? The Mayfly is perfect.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="9b478e4a-914f-4f5f-9fa7-9585aff7b7c5" class="r-1hu6ibp"><div data-rid="527663dd-c967-492a-aed4-69b2e62b3508" class="r-1s5uzdl alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Customers Testimonials</p></span></div><div data-rid="298eb841-a90b-4bf4-a876-b1b92d9b64b7" class="r-17h9phf" data-alchemy-prerendered-component-id="298eb841-a90b-4bf4-a876-b1b92d9b64b7">{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-begin{%- endcomment -%}<div style="width:100%;height:100%" data-alchemy-prerendered-placeholder="true">
